{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Dedekindζ-函数"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Dedekind ζ-函数”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $K$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"数域","text":"数域"}},{"Plain":", 定义其 Dedekind ζ-函数为\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\sum_{\\mathfrak a\\subset\\mathcal O_K}\\frac{1}{(\\# \\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak a)^s} = \\prod_{\\mathfrak p\\subset\\mathcal O_K\\,\\text{prime}}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{(\\#\\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak p)^s}\\right)^{-1}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>Dedekind ζ-函数的非平凡零点记录了 $\\mathcal O_K$ 的素理想分布的信息.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"ζ-函数","text":"ζ-函数"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}